{"seq":1,"slug":"problems-of-forms","title":"Problems Of Forms","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/problems-of-forms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-third-man-argument","title":"第三人论证","url":"/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/problems-of-forms/the-third-man-argument","wordCount":1868,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"platos-self-critique","title":"柏拉图的自我批判","url":"/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/problems-of-forms/platos-self-critique","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章审视理念论所面临的理论难题。最著名的\"第三人论证\"，揭示了理念论关于\"分有\"关系的根本困难——它可能导致无穷后退；而最早提出这一难题的，正是柏拉图本人（在《巴门尼德篇》中）。本章进而探讨柏拉图可贵的自我批判精神——一位伟大思想家，能够对自己最核心的学说提出尖锐诘难，这正是其思想之诚实、开放与深刻的体现。\n"}